<%#
  The Nikkilog logo: the wordmark, the Japanese subtitle, and the orange dot from
  the original lockup.

  Drawn as HTML rather than an <img src="logo.svg"> on purpose. An SVG loaded via
  <img> renders in isolation and cannot use the page's fonts, so the wordmark
  would fall back to a system font instead of Plus Jakarta Sans. As real text it
  stays crisp, uses the site's own font, and can be read by a screen reader.

  Colours are the light-background variants. The original #E0E0E0 wordmark was
  drawn for a dark ground and has 1.26:1 contrast against this header.
%>
<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Nikkilog — home">
    <span class="brand-lockup">
        <span class="brand-name">Nikkilog<span class="brand-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
        <span class="brand-kanji" lang="ja">日記ログ</span>
    </span>
</a>
